    "/api/v1/agent/status": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "agentStatus",
        "summary": "Get agent status",
        "description": "Whether the agent is up and busy: sandbox state, last activity, and the next scheduled wake.\n\nRequires the `results:read` scope.\n\n**Response.** ```json\n{ \"status\": { \"sandbox\": \"alive\", \"running\": false, \"lastActivityAt\": 1789832474865, \"lastTurnAt\": 1789832490530, \"pendingWakes\": 2, \"nextWakeAt\": 1790002800000 } }\n```\n\n`running` is derived: a turn that started in the last 30 minutes and has not finished. A `dead` sandbox is normal between turns; the next message or wake spawns one.",
        "tags": [
          "API Reference"
        ],
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://revnu.com/docs/agent-status"
